1
00:06:16,666 --> 00:06:22,666
Wife to the king. Icon to the world. Destined for more.

2
00:12:33,333 --> 00:12:39,333
Priscilla is a drama, romance film directed by Sofia Coppola.

3
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:56,000
When teenage Priscilla Beaulieu meets Elvis Presley at a party, the man who is already a meteoric rock-and-roll superstar becomes
someone entirely unexpected in private moments: a thrilling crush, an ally in loneliness, a vulnerable best friend.

4
00:25:06,666 --> 00:25:12,666
Priscilla, played by Cailee Spaeny.

5
00:31:23,333 --> 00:31:29,333
Elvis, played by Jacob Elordi.

6
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:46,000
Captain Beaulieu, played by Ari Cohen.

7
00:43:56,666 --> 00:44:02,666
Ann Beaulieu, played by Dagmara Dominczyk.

8
00:50:13,333 --> 00:50:19,333
Vernon Presley, played by Tim Post.

9
00:56:30,000 --> 00:56:36,000
Grandma 'Dodger', played by Lynne Griffin.

10
01:02:46,666 --> 01:02:52,666
Priscilla is a 2023 American biographical drama film written, directed, and produced by Sofia Coppola, based on the
1985 memoir Elvis and Me by Priscilla Presley (who serves as an executive producer) and Sandra Harmon.

11
01:09:03,333 --> 01:09:09,333
It follows the life of Priscilla (Cailee Spaeny) and her complicated
romantic relationship with Elvis Presley (Jacob Elordi).

12
01:15:20,000 --> 01:15:26,000
Priscilla premiered at the 80th Venice International Film Festival on
September 4, 2023, where Spaeny won the Volpi Cup for Best Actress.

13
01:21:36,666 --> 01:21:42,666
It was released in the United States by A24 in select theaters on
October 27, 2023, before expanding wide on November 3, 2023.

14
01:27:53,333 --> 01:27:59,333
It received generally positive reviews from critics
and grossed $33 million worldwide.

15
01:34:10,000 --> 01:34:16,000
In addition to her award from Venice, Spaeny received a Best Actress
nomination at the Golden Globe Awards for her performance.

16
01:40:26,666 --> 01:40:32,666
The film explores themes of jealousy, husband wife
relationship, obsession, 1970s, drug addiction.

17
01:46:43,333 --> 01:46:49,333
The tone is mind_bending and emotional and intense.
